{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1485855-subliminal-messaging-and-other-affects-that-target-mass-groups-of-people","id":1485855,"title":"Subliminal Messaging and other affects that target mass groups of people","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-05T12:49:25-07:00","id":1485855,"title":"Subliminal Messaging and other affects that target mass groups of people","content":"I've been running Mage for awhile, but as is the case with this game, there are always questions that linger in the back of my mind on how mechanically to get things to work.<br /> <br /> Specifically for this, it's the question of &quot;Spells that affect large groups of people&quot;. Something like a commercial that has a mind altering subliminal message inside of it, or something like a rock concert. For effects like these you're not really going to use the &quot;Targets&quot; part of successes since you're unlikely to score hundreds of successes needed for a concert. The subliminal messaging one is even more out there in terms of what it's doing as it's not affecting everyone who views the commercial. How do people normally decide on how these work mechanically for the players to do?<br /> <br /> Another question in a similar vein is, how does locking an effect into the Forces pattern work? It's a pattern sphere so you should be able to lock an effect into it, but would it lock it only into the actual force, or into the source of it? An example would be locking an effect into the light from a light bulb. Would it only lock it into the light that's traveling from the light bulb that was emitted at the time of casting the spell, or would it lock it into the &quot;idea&quot; of the light from the light bulb, affecting everything the light from the bulb is touching while the spell is active?<br /> <br /> Lastly, what about for spells like casting an effect on a piece of art you made that makes people who view it be in a better mood. If you are locking the effect into the art piece you could theoretically put it anywhere that people can see it. Would you need Correspondence mixed into the Mind/Matter for the ability to have anyone who looked at it be affected?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7550-vulcan7200","name":"Vulcan7200","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-05T13:10:41-07:00","id":1485857,"title":"","content":"Consider using Ventures and Prime in a manner similar to the correspondence range chart. That is, two dots of Prime allow you to target your Effect at an abstraction to which many of the people in your audience belong. The number of additional successes for targeting a Venture instead of a person is based on the size of the Venture: say, two successes per rank of the Venture.<br /> <br /> For the painting, I'd argue that it should be a Wonder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-05T19:29:38-07:00","id":1485875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vulcan7200</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1485855-subliminal-messaging-and-other-affects-that-target-mass-groups-of-people#post1485855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bI've been running Mage for awhile, but as is the case with this game, there are always questions that linger in the back of my mind on how mechanically to get things to work.<br /> <br /> Specifically for this, it's the question of &quot;Spells that affect large groups of people&quot;. Something like a commercial that has a mind altering subliminal message inside of it, or something like a rock concert. For effects like these you're not really going to use the &quot;Targets&quot; part of successes since you're unlikely to score hundreds of successes needed for a concert. The subliminal messaging one is even more out there in terms of what it's doing as it's not affecting everyone who views the commercial. How do people normally decide on how these work mechanically for the players to do?</div> </div> </div> </div>If the goal is to influence the masses and rules for magic alone severely limit the number of people you can influence, use Abilities Enhanced by Magic. With Mind 1 and Life 3, you can increase all the relevant Attributes. Then, you can use effects on yourself to lower the difficulty of the Ability roll. Intelligence + Science (Psychology) would determine how well you plan the concealment and persuasive power of the subliminal message. Intelligence + Crafts would determine the quality of the art in which the message is concealed, which in turn determines how many people it reaches. If you are the messenger, such as a singer, Manipulation + Subterfuge for the subliminal message and Charisma + Art for the overall performance.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vulcan7200</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1485855-subliminal-messaging-and-other-affects-that-target-mass-groups-of-people#post1485855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another question in a similar vein is, how does locking an effect into the Forces pattern work? It's a pattern sphere so you should be able to lock an effect into it, but would it lock it only into the actual force, or into the source of it? An example would be locking an effect into the light from a light bulb. Would it only lock it into the light that's traveling from the light bulb that was emitted at the time of casting the spell, or would it lock it into the &quot;idea&quot; of the light from the light bulb, affecting everything the light from the bulb is touching while the spell is active?</div> </div> </div> </div>When light strikes almost any solid indoor surface, it is converted into heat. If the lightbulb is outside, the enchanted light escapes from you at light speed. If you Enchant the <i>filament</i> of the bulb, then it could probably work in the way you intend, but I would say within a limited range.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vulcan7200</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1485855-subliminal-messaging-and-other-affects-that-target-mass-groups-of-people#post1485855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lastly, what about for spells like casting an effect on a piece of art you made that makes people who view it be in a better mood. If you are locking the effect into the art piece you could theoretically put it anywhere that people can see it. Would you need Correspondence mixed into the Mind/Matter for the ability to have anyone who looked at it be affected?</div> </div> </div> </div>With Matter/Mind alone, I would say it affects anyone close enough to examine it, even briefly. Correspondence would extend the range. Making it huge and displaying it on a hilltop works as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-06T05:28:43-07:00","id":1485900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1485855-subliminal-messaging-and-other-affects-that-target-mass-groups-of-people?p=1485875#post1485875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If the goal is to influence the masses and rules for magic alone severely limit the number of people you can influence, use Abilities Enhanced by Magic. With Mind 1 and Life 3, you can increase all the relevant Attributes. Then, you can use effects on yourself to lower the difficulty of the Ability roll. Intelligence + Science (Psychology) would determine how well you plan the concealment and persuasive power of the subliminal message. Intelligence + Crafts would determine the quality of the art in which the message is concealed, which in turn determines how many people it reaches. If you are the messenger, such as a singer, Manipulation + Subterfuge for the subliminal message and Charisma + Art for the overall performance.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> When light strikes almost any solid indoor surface, it is converted into heat. If the lightbulb is outside, the enchanted light escapes from you at light speed. If you Enchant the <i>filament</i> of the bulb, then it could probably work in the way you intend, but I would say within a limited range.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> With Matter/Mind alone, I would say it affects anyone close enough to examine it, even briefly. Correspondence would extend the range. Making it huge and displaying it on a hilltop works as well.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks! These are all helpful. I especially like your suggestion for Subliminal Messaging. My group (Including myself) tends to forget about enhancing abilities with Magick outside of combat.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7550-vulcan7200","name":"Vulcan7200","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}